<li>Does <strong>not</strong> rewrite pick, LP, RP/RD, scoring, chart or database logic.</li>
<li>Does <strong>not</strong> write your JSON, Content Manager, themes helper, profile redesign, production team.php or production profile.php.</li>
<li>Original v008 is backed up before the one file that is replaced.</li>
</ul>
<p>Generated file size: 82,199 → 67,838 bytes. Consolidated style block: 28,837 → 15,174 bytes.</p>
<?php if(!$apply): ?><form method="post"><input type="hidden" name="apply" value="1"><button>Install Consolidated v009</button></form><?php endif; ?>
</div><?php endif; ?>
<?php if($apply): ?><div class="card"><h2>Apply Result</h2><p class="<?php echo $success?'ok':'bad'; ?>"><strong><?php echo $success?'SUCCESS':'FAILED'; ?></strong></p><ul><?php foreach($msgs as $m): ?><li><?php echo ih($m); ?></li><?php endforeach; ?></ul><?php if($success): ?><p><a href="/team_redesign.php" target="_blank">Open Team Redesign v009</a></p><?php endif; ?></div><?php endif; ?>
</div></body></html>